OL,3,GNEWSAJudge halts murder trial after
OL,4,Atechnical problem
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has halted a murder trial after
OL,7,Ftelling jurors that a technical issue
OL,8,Fwas causing problems at the courthouse.
OL,10,FJohn Mills, 46, of Marriott Street in
OL,11,FNorthampton, denies murdering John
OL,12,FBoyle, 71, who was found dead in his
OL,13,Fflat in Kettering, Northamptonshire, in
OL,14,FOctober 2025.
OL,16,FJudge Rebecca Crane said a system which
OL,17,Frecorded proceedings at Northampton
OL,18,FCrown Court was not working.
OL,20,FThe judge told jurors that they would
OL,21,Fnot need to return to court until
OL,22,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
